## Summary

Ported the web `useVehicleSettings.ts` hook domain (all 3 hooks) to UI-free KMP shared-core state holders at web parity.

**Files added (`apps/shared/core`):**
- `presentation/vehiclesettings/VehicleSettingsModels.kt` ΓÇö `EffectiveSettingSource` (enum, SerialName wire), `EffectiveSetting` (value as `JsonElement` = web `unknown`), `VehicleSettingsResponse`, and the `findEffectiveSetting` selector.
- `data/repo/VehicleSettingsRepository.kt` ΓÇö S7 port: 1 read + 2 mutations, `vehicleSettingsCacheKey`, `upsertVehicleSettingBody`, TTL constant.
- `data/repo/HttpVehicleSettingsRepository.kt` ΓÇö Ktor/cache impl; key percent-encoded via `encodeURLPathPart` (= `encodeURIComponent`); evicts the detail key on success.
- `presentation/vehiclesettings/VehicleSettingsStore.kt` ΓÇö shared `StateFlow` feed + suspend `Result` mutations; refreshes the feed and fires `onVehicleChanged` (the cross-domain `vehicleKeys.detail` analogue).
- `cache/CacheDomain.kt` ΓÇö new `VehicleSettings("vehicle_settings", 30.seconds)` matching the web `staleTime: 30_000`.
- Store + Golden tests (fake-repo): cacheΓåÆnetwork emission, feed-sharing, per-vehicle invalidation granularity, mutation routing, failure-no-refresh, and golden-locked derivations (cache key, upsert body, decode, selector).

**Parity mapping:** `useVehicleSettings`ΓåÆ`vehicleSettings`, `useUpsertVehicleSetting`ΓåÆ`upsertVehicleSetting` (PUT `{value}` verbatim), `useResetVehicleSetting`ΓåÆ`resetVehicleSetting` (idempotent DELETE). Both mutations evict the detail key + delegate `vehicleKeys.detail(id)` to `onVehicleChanged`. SI preserved (no unit-bearing fields).

**Gate:** `TEST_EXIT=0`, `LINT_EXIT=0`, `PH_EXIT=0` ΓåÆ `EXIT=0` / `STATUS=DONE`. Log at `.github/prompts/monorepo/logs/p1-s8-0057-vehiclesettings.log` with the `=== PARITY ===` enumeration. (Unrelated pre-existing `done.txt` modification was left unstaged to keep the commit within the allowed file scope.)


